<table style="float:right; background-color:#eeeeee; border:2px #999999 solid; padding:4px; margin:4px; width:220px;">

<tr>
<th align="center"> {{{title}}}
</th></tr>
<tr>
<td>
<p>{{{contents}}}
</p>
</td></tr></table>
<p>Format:
</p>
<pre>
 {{infobox template
 |title=
 |contents=
 |collapsed=
 }}
</pre>
<p>If you put the string "yes" in the collapsed= parameter, the table will be collapsible and will default to hidden.
</p><p>If you put the string "no" in the collapsed= parameter, the table will be collapsible and will default to shown.
</p><p>Any other value in the collapsed= parameter, or no value at all, will make the table non-collapsible.
</p>
